import{_ as s,o as a,c as n,aO as t}from"./chunks/framework.vjUPZZJn.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"SWIG 包装 std::size_t 报 Fragment not found 排查","description":"","frontmatter":{"date":"2026-11-11T20:30:00.000Z","title":"SWIG 包装 std::size_t 报 Fragment not found 排查","source":[["1-知识/工具/CMake与构建/SWIG size_t fragment 报错排查"]],"tags":["工具","问题排查","SWIG","Python"],"categories":["问题排查"],"permalink":"/pages/2dd00d"},"headers":[],"relativePath":"问题排查/SWIG 包装 std size_t 报 Fragment not found 排查.md","filePath":"问题排查/SWIG 包装 std size_t 报 Fragment not found 排查.md","lastUpdated":1794424347000}'),i={name:"问题排查/SWIG 包装 std size_t 报 Fragment not found 排查.md"};function d(o,e,p,r,l,c){return a(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[t(`<h1 id="swig-包装-std-size-t-报-fragment-not-found-排查" tabindex="-1">SWIG 包装 std::size_t 报 Fragment not found 排查 <a class="header-anchor" href="#swig-包装-std-size-t-报-fragment-not-found-排查" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;SWIG 包装 std::size_t 报 Fragment not found 排查&quot;">​</a></h1> <p>用 SWIG 给 C++ 库生成 Python 绑定，接口里一旦出现 <code>size_t</code>——无论是 <code>std::pair&lt;bool, size_t&gt;</code> 还是 <code>std::vector&lt;size_t&gt;</code>——Python 侧拿到的就是打不开的 <code>SwigPyObject</code>，编译期还会伴随 <code>Fragment &#39;SWIG_AsVal_std_size_t&#39; not found</code> 警告。这篇记录完整的排查过程、根因和当前可用的 workaround。</p> <h2 id="问题现象" tabindex="-1">问题现象 <a class="header-anchor" href="#问题现象" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;问题现象&quot;">​</a></h2> <p><code>.i</code> 接口文件里已经用 <code>%template</code> 声明了模板实例：</p> <div class="language-swig vp-adaptive-theme line-numbers-mode"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">swig</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span>%template(BoolSizeTPair) std::pair&lt;bool, size_t&gt;;</span></span></code></pre> <div class="line-numbers-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><span class="line-number">1</span><br></div></div><p>生成与编译都能通过，但 Python 侧调用返回 <code>pair</code> 的接口时报错：</p> <div class="language- vp-adaptive-theme line-numbers-mode"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang"></span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span>cannot unpack non-iterable SwigPyObject object</span></span></code></pre> <div class="line-numbers-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><span class="line-number">1</span><br></div></div><p>返回值没有被打包成 Python 元组，而是一个裸的 <code>SwigPyObject</code>——说明 SWIG 没有为这个类型生成正确的转换代码。</p> <h2 id="排查过程" tabindex="-1">排查过程 <a class="header-anchor" href="#排查过程" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;排查过程&quot;">​</a></h2> <p>怀疑是 <code>size_t</code> 的命名空间形式影响匹配，把模板实例化改为显式的 <code>std::size_t</code>：</p> <div class="language-swig vp-adaptive-theme line-numbers-mode"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">swig</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span>%template(BoolSizeTPair) std::pair&lt;bool, std::size_t&gt;;</span></span></code></pre> <div class="line-numbers-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><span class="line-number">1</span><br></div></div><p>这次编译器给出了更有价值的线索——两条警告：</p> <div class="language- vp-adaptive-theme line-numbers-mode"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang"></span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span>swig.i:221: Warning 490: Fragment &#39;SWIG_AsVal_std_size_t&#39; not found.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>swig.i:221: Warning 490: Fragment &#39;SWIG_From_std_size_t&#39; not found.</span></span></code></pre> <div class="line-numbers-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><span class="line-number">1</span><br><span class="line-number">2</span><br></div></div><p>Fragment 是 SWIG typemap 系统里的类型转换代码片段。<code>SWIG_AsVal_std_size_t</code> / <code>SWIG_From_std_size_t</code> 找不到，意味着 SWIG 不知道如何在 <code>std::size_t</code> 与目标语言类型之间转换。</p> <h2 id="根因" tabindex="-1">根因 <a class="header-anchor" href="#根因" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;根因&quot;">​</a></h2> <p>在 <a href="https://github.com/swig/swig/issues/1712" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">swig/swig#1712</a> 中，维护者 wsfulton 确认了根因：<code>std::size_t</code> 只在 C++ 头文件 <code>&lt;cstddef&gt;</code> 中定义，而 SWIG 的库文件目录里<strong>没有对应的 <code>cstddef.i</code></strong>，类型信息缺失导致 fragment 查找失败。</p> <p>值得注意的是，截至该 issue 最近的讨论（2025 年 10 月），官方修复仍处于推迟状态——<code>%apply</code> 方式对 Python 目标不生效，typedef 方式又触发 <code>SwigType_type()</code> 的无限递归 bug，因此<strong>升级 SWIG 版本目前解决不了这个问题</strong>。该问题还可能影响 octave、r、ruby、scilab 等其他目标语言。</p> <h2 id="解决方案" tabindex="-1">解决方案 <a class="header-anchor" href="#解决方案" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;解决方案&quot;">​</a></h2> <p>issue 中由报告者提出、维护者认可的 workaround，是在 <code>.i</code> 文件中把全局 <code>::size_t</code> 引入 <code>std</code> 命名空间：</p> <div class="language-swig vp-adaptive-theme line-numbers-mode"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">swig</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span>namespace std {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  typedef ::size_t size_t;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>}</span></span></code></pre> <div class="line-numbers-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><span class="line-number">1</span><br><span class="line-number">2</span><br><span class="line-number">3</span><br></div></div><p>这样 SWIG 在解析 <code>std::size_t</code> 时能关联到已知的全局 <code>size_t</code> 类型，fragment 查找即可命中。（该写法来自 issue 讨论，使用前建议在自己的工程里验证。）</p> <h2 id="另一路尝试及其局限" tabindex="-1">另一路尝试及其局限 <a class="header-anchor" href="#另一路尝试及其局限" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;另一路尝试及其局限&quot;">​</a></h2> <p>SWIG 1.3 官方文档在讲基本类型时给过另一种处理 <code>size_t</code> 的思路（<a href="http://www.swig.org/Doc1.3/SWIG.html#SWIG_nn20" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">SWIG.html#SWIG_nn20</a>）：</p> <div class="language-swig vp-adaptive-theme line-numbers-mode"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">swig</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span>%inline %{</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>typedef long unsigned int size_t;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>%}</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>namespace std {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  %template(VecSize) vector&lt;size_t&gt;;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>}</span></span></code></pre> <div class="line-numbers-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><span class="line-number">1</span><br><span class="line-number">2</span><br><span class="line-number">3</span><br><span class="line-number">4</span><br><span class="line-number">5</span><br><span class="line-number">6</span><br><span class="line-number">7</span><br></div></div><p>注意 <code>%inline</code> 只是把 typedef 插入生成的包装代码，并不等同于向 SWIG 声明 <code>std::size_t</code> 这个类型；对 <code>std::</code> 限定形式触发的 fragment 缺失，这条路径未必有效。issue #1712 中也未讨论该写法，优先采用上一节的 <code>namespace std</code> 方案。</p> <h2 id="小结" tabindex="-1">小结 <a class="header-anchor" href="#小结" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;小结&quot;">​</a></h2> <p>SWIG 绑定中 <code>size_t</code> 相关模板报 <code>Fragment &#39;SWIG_AsVal_std_size_t&#39; not found</code> 或 Python 侧拿到裸 <code>SwigPyObject</code>，根因是 SWIG 缺少 <code>cstddef.i</code>、没有 <code>std::size_t</code> 的类型信息。当前版本的可行解法是在接口文件里加 <code>namespace std { typedef ::size_t size_t; }</code>；官方修复截至 2025 年 10 月仍未合入，升级版本无效。</p> <h2 id="参考" tabindex="-1">参考 <a class="header-anchor" href="#参考" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;参考&quot;">​</a></h2> <ul><li><a href="https://github.com/swig/swig/issues/1712" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Missing definition for std::size_t when targeting Python? · swig/swig#1712</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.swig.org/Doc1.3/SWIG.html#SWIG_nn20" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">SWIG 1.3 文档：基本类型处理</a></li></ul>`,51)])])}const h=s(i,[["render",d]]);export{g as __pageData,h as default};
